#: minicli.cpp:458
msgid "Run in &terminal"
msgstr "Enonder dvins on &terminå"

#: minicli.cpp:459
msgid ""
"Check this option if the application you want to run is a text mode "
"application. The application will then be run in a terminal emulator window."
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:465
msgid "Run as a different &user"
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:466
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run the application with a different user "
"id.  Every process has a user id associated with it. This id code determines "
"file access and other permissions. The password of the user is required to "
"do this."
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:477
msgid "user&name:"
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:480
msgid "Enter the user here who you want to run the application as."
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:487
msgid "Run with a different &priority"
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:488
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run the application with a different "
"priority. A higher priority tells the operating system to give more "
"processing time to your application."
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:499
msgid "pr&iority:"
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:502
msgid ""
"The priority can be set here. From left to right, it goes from low to high. "
"The center position is the default value. For priorities higher than the "
"default, you will need root's password."
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:511
msgid "high"
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:518
msgid "&scheduler:"
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:521
msgid ""
"Here you can select which scheduler to use for the application. The "
"scheduler is that part of the operating system which decides what process "
"will run and which will have to wait. Two schedulers are "
"available:<ul><li><em>Normal:</em> This is the standard, timesharing "
"scheduler. It will fairly divide the available processing time over all "
"processes. </li><li><em>Realtime:</em> This scheduler will run your "
"application uninterrupted until it gives up the processor. This can be "
"dangerous. An application that does not give up the processor might hang the "
"system. You need root's password to use this scheduler."
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:545
msgid "pass&word:"
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:548
msgid "Enter the requested password here."
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:571
msgid "Normal"
msgstr ""

#: minicli.cpp:572
msgid "Realtime"
msgstr ""

